<a id="local-action"></a>
## Local action

Example input:

```yaml
# select: missing-action-input,unknown-action-input
on: push
jobs:
  test:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: ./.github/actions/greet
        with:
          nmae: octocat
```

Example file: .github/actions/greet/action.yml

```yaml
name: Greet
description: Says hello
inputs:
  name:
    description: Who to greet
    required: true
runs:
  using: composite
  steps:
    - run: echo hello
      shell: bash
```

Example config:

```yaml
rules:
  unknown-action-input: warn
```

Output:

```
THIS WILL BE GENERATED
```

